  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"967\" data-end=\"1170\">\n<p data-start=\"969\" data-end=\"1037\">Abnormal patterns suggest <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1026\">inborn errors of metabolism</strong> such as:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1170\">\n<li data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1070\">\n<p data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1070\"><strong data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1068\">Methylmalonic acidemia</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1073\" data-end=\"1099\">\n<p data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1099\"><strong data-start=\"1075\" data-end=\"1097\">Propionic acidemia</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1127\">\n<p data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1104\" data-end=\"1125\">Glutaric aciduria</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1170\">\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1168\">Maple Syrup Urine Disease (MSUD)</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1265\">\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1265\">Further confirmation via <strong data-start=\"1198\" data-end=\"1223\">quantitative analysis</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1246\">genetic testing</strong> may be recommended</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
